00:00:00,580 --> 00:00:03,080
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) The Smiths take turns washing dishes.

2
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:05,760
Mom washes dishes on Monday.

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,420
Dad washes dishes on Tuesday.

4
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:11,560
Samantha washes dishes on Wednesday.

5
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:15,280
Then, the cycle starts all over again.

6
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:19,680
Today is Wednesday, so it is Samantha's turn.

7
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:23,540
Samantha takes the dirty dishes from the dining

8
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:23,980
table.

9
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:26,320
She puts them in the sink.

10
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:29,320
She squeezes a drop of soap on the

11
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:29,840
sponge.

12
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:32,960
She washes the dishes with the sponge.

13
00:00:33,680 --> 00:00:36,400
She sings to herself to make the job

14
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,160
go easier.

15
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:40,600
She rinses the dishes off with water.

16
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:43,360
She dries them with a towel.

17
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:46,600
She puts them back in the dish holder.

18
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:49,560
She wants to buy a dishwasher.
